考究。\n\n- **环境与背景**：\n  - 场景位于一个阳光明媚的户外花园，背景是茂密的绿色植物和缤纷的野花。\n  - 左后方有粉色、白色、黄色的玫瑰花丛；前景和右侧则点缀着雏菊、小野花等，色彩丰富但不杂乱。\n  - 光线来自左上方，属于自然日光，柔和地洒在人物身上，在裙面和头发上形成高光，同时在身体右侧投下轻微阴影，增强立体感。\n  - 整体构图采用中心对称式，人物居中，背景虚化（浅景深），突出主体。\n\n- **图像风格与技术特征**：\n  - 图像清晰度高，色彩还原真实，光影过渡自然。\n  - 左上角有“AI生成”水印，表明此图为人工智能生成图像，具有高度写实但略带理想化的美感。\n  - 风格偏向商业时尚摄影或高端电商模特图，强调服装展示与氛围营造。\n\n---\n\n### ✨ 优化后的提示词（Prompt）\n\n以下是根据不同用途（如AI绘图、产品宣传、广告文案等）优化后的提示词：\n\n#### 💡 通用版提示词（适用于AI绘图工具如Midjourney, DALL·E, Stable Diffusion等）：\n\n```\nA beautiful young woman with curly brown hair and fair skin, wearing a stylish dusty blue A-line midi dress with thin straps, square neckline, and front buttons. Standing gracefully in a sunlit garden filled with blooming roses and wildflowers. Soft natural lighting, shallow depth of field, photorealistic style, high detail, elegant and serene atmosphere. --v 6.0 --ar 3:4 --q 2\n```\n\n#### 🛍️ 电商/服装展示专用提示词：\n\n```\nProfessional fashion photo of a female model showcasing a chic blue sleeveless midi dress with waist definition and flared skirt. Set in a vibrant summer garden with lush greenery and colorful flowers. Bright daylight, clean composition, focus on garment details (buttons, seams, fabric texture). Ideal for e-commerce or catalog use.\n```\n\n#### 🎨 艺术/审美强化版提示词：\n\n```\nEthereal portrait of a gentle woman in a vintage-inspired blue sundress, surrounded by a dreamy floral meadow under golden hour sunlight. Delicate curls frame her face, soft gaze meets the viewer. Cinematic lighting, painterly realism, romantic and tranquil mood. Inspired by fashion editorial photography.\n```\n\n#### 📸 中文优化提示词（适合中文AI平台如通义万相、文心一格等）：\n\n```\n一位拥有卷曲棕发和清澈蓝眸的年轻女性，身穿雾霾蓝色A字吊带连衣裙，胸前饰有三颗纽扣，腰线修身，裙摆飘逸。站在阳光洒落的花园中，背景是盛开的玫瑰与野花，绿意盎然。自然光柔和，浅景深突出人物，画面清新优雅，写实风格，高清细节，适合时尚摄影。\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 提示词优化要点总结：\n\n1. **明确主体特征**：年龄、发型、肤色、眼神、姿态。\n2. **细化服装元素**：颜色、款式、剪裁、材质、装饰（如纽扣、缝线）。\n3. **环境氛围渲染**：地点（花园）、植物种类、光线方向与强度、季节感（夏季）。\n4. **视觉风格指定**：写实/梦幻/电影感/商业风，是否需要浅景深、高分辨率等。\n5. **添加参数控制**（如适用）：版本号、宽高比、质量等级等。\n\n---\n\n✅ 使用这些优化后的提示词，可以更精准地引导AI生成符合你预期的画面，无论是用于创作、营销还是学习研究都非常实用。希望这份详尽解析对你有所帮助！"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 18, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "9947b8be70e17ceabafa4fa7f476b54626de4704", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "description", "links": [18, 21], "label": "description", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "description"}], "size": [359.0909118652344, 276.9090881347656], "pos": [2227.56591796875, 1679.182861328125], "widgets_values": ["详细描述一下这张图片,并优化提示词", "", "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct", 4000, 0.7000000000000001, 1, 1963829153], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 17, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_token"}, "name": "api_token", "label": "api_token", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_token"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "shape": 7, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "shape": 7, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "shape": 7, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "QwenVisionNode", "properties": {"ver": "bf36e9b731a0d19f68e302230dd1e85b341ef077", "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true, "max_tokens": true, "api_token": true, "temperature": true, "model": true, "prompt": true}, "aux_id": "111496583yzy/comfyui-modelscope-qwen-image", "Node name for S&R": "QwenVisionNode"}, "or